# Story 39: Softdev Pipeline (55s)
# Hook: A full software development pipeline -- planning, coding, linting, testing.
# Duration: 55s
# Source: story-39-softdev-pipeline.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 11

[00:00.0 --> 00:04.0]
Start rysh -- orchestrate a full dev pipeline.

[00:04.0 --> 00:08.0]
The orchestrator pane drives the pipeline.

[00:08.0 --> 00:14.0]
A listener pane watches the pipeline progress.

[00:14.0 --> 00:18.0]
Switch back to the orchestrator to run the pipeline.

[00:18.0 --> 00:22.0]
The softdev pipeline has four phases.

[00:22.0 --> 00:28.0]
Phase 1 triggers the AI planning event. The AI analyzes requirements and creates a plan.

[00:28.0 --> 00:34.0]
Phase 2 triggers AI-driven code generation.

[00:34.0 --> 00:40.0]
Phase 3 runs shell-based linting on the generated code.

[00:40.0 --> 00:46.0]
Phase 4 runs shell-based unit tests.

[00:46.0 --> 00:50.0]
Each phase builds on context from previous phases. A 50KB buffer carries state across the pipeline.

[00:50.0 --> 00:55.0]
Softdev pipeline -- plan, code, lint, test, all orchestrated.

